      "body": "A new GGML_OP (GGML_OP_BITNET_MUL_MAT) was added in ggml.h.\nEvery tensor in llama.cpp has an op field; when the graph is built, any\nweight matrix that is BitNet-quantized (type GGML_TYPE_Q2_0, Q3_0,\netc.) is wrapped in a tensor whose op is set to GGML_OP_BITNET_MUL_MAT.",
